Package: pamPatterns
Type: Package
Title: Pattern Analysis for Passive Acoustic Monitoring Data
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Lucas",
                   family = "Beseler",
                   email = "lucas.beseler@hs-anhalt.de",
                   role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides comprehensive tools for reading acoustic detection data (e.g., from
    BirdNET), calculating an extensive set of quantitative pattern indicators related to 
    confidence scores, temporal distribution, spatial patterns, and statistical anomalies. 
    Includes advanced filtering options, data quality assessment, visualization tools, and 
    anomaly detection to facilitate quality control and prioritization for manual validation 
    of acoustic monitoring results. The package emphasizes discovering and understanding 
    patterns in PAM data through both traditional metrics and machine learning approaches.
